  "description": "Proposed single story rear extension with associated internal alterations ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development due to its excessive scale and bulk and unsympathetic\r\ndesign would give rise to an unduly obtrusive and incongruous extension which\r\nwould fail to respect the scale of the subject dwelling and would not preserve\r\nand enhance the character and appearance of the locally listed building, to the\r\ndetriment of the character and appearance of the host building, locality and\r\nthe visual amenities of the neighbouring occupiers, contrary to the high\r\nquality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicies D3 D.1, D.11,D.12 and D.7 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Core\r\nPolicy CS1 (B) and D of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012, policies DM 1 &amp;nbsp;and\r\nDM 7 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the\r\nadopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
